M_DISGUISED="write the command plainly: no eval, no pipes into a shell or interpreter, no command names built from variables/quotes/escapes, no decoding, no command runners around git/gh/ssh/curl/wget, and no GIT_*/PATH/LD_PRELOAD/DYLD_* overrides."
